{
 "duration": 25.955,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Every climb, Jake blamed his legs.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.443
  },
  {
   "text": "Burning thighs, sore shoulders, last in the group.",
   "start": 2.743,
   "end": 5.308
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a guide stopped him at the trailhead and looked at his poles.",
   "start": 5.758,
   "end": 9.065
  },
  {
   "text": "Way too long. Hands up by his chin.",
   "start": 9.365,
   "end": 11.624
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 12.124,
   "end": 13.051
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand straight, grip the handle, and set the pole so your elbow sits at ninety degrees.",
   "start": 13.401,
   "end": 18.382
  },
  {
   "text": "Shorter going uphill, longer going down.",
   "start": 18.782,
   "end": 21.332
  },
  {
   "text": "Next hike? He led the group.",
   "start": 21.882,
   "end": 23.539
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next climb.",
   "start": 24.039,
   "end": 25.755
  }
 ],
